# Terraform AWS Infrastructure

## Project Overview

This project demonstrates Infrastructure as Code (IaC) using Terraform to provision and manage AWS cloud infrastructure.

## Technologies

- Terraform
- AWS
- Amazon VPC
- IAM
- Security Groups
- Linux

## Architecture

The project is designed to demonstrate automated AWS infrastructure provisioning using Terraform.

Planned infrastructure includes:

- VPC
- Public and private subnets
- Internet Gateway
- Route tables
- Security groups
- IAM configuration

## Terraform Workflow

1. Configure AWS provider
2. Define infrastructure using Terraform
3. Initialize Terraform
4. Validate configuration
5. Review infrastructure changes
6. Apply infrastructure configuration

## Learning Objectives

- Understand Infrastructure as Code
- Automate AWS infrastructure provisioning
- Practice Terraform configuration
- Understand AWS networking fundamentals
- Apply basic cloud security principles

## Project Status

🚧 Currently building and expanding this project with practical Terraform configurations.
